Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 10:13:49 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Bundle Protocol Buffers highlighting

Messages carry colors, fields wear names,
No server wakes to play these games.
From proto two to streaming three,
The grammar ships internally.
